#: kiconedit.cpp:786
msgid ""
"Icon draw grid\n"
"\n"
"The icon grid is the area where you draw the icons.\n"
"You can zoom in and out using the magnifying glasses on the toolbar.\n"
"(Tip: Hold the magnify button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined "
"scale"
msgstr ""
"图标绘制网格\n"
"\n"
"图标网格是用来绘制图标的区域。\n"
"可以使用工具栏上的放大镜按钮放大或缩小视图。\n"
"（提示：按住放大按钮数秒可缩放到预设比例）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:791
msgid ""
"Rulers\n"
"\n"
"This is a visual represantation of the current cursor position"
msgstr ""
"标尺\n"
"\n"
"这是当前光标位置的直观显示。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:795
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information of the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors\n"
"\t- Application messages"
msgstr ""
"状态栏\n"
"\n"
"状态栏用于显示当前图标的状态信息。可显示的字段包括：\n"
"\n"
"\t- 光标位置\n"
"\t- 大小\n"
"\t- 缩放比例\n"
"\t- 颜色数\n"
"\t- 应用程序消息"

#: kiconedit.cpp:804
msgid ""
"Preview\n"
"\n"
"This is a 1:1 preview of the current icon"
msgstr ""
"预览\n"
"\n"
"这是当前图标的 1:1 预览"

#: kiconedit.cpp:807
msgid ""
"System colors\n"
"\n"
"Here you can select colors from the KDE Icon Palette."
msgstr ""
"系统颜色\n"
"\n"
"您可以从此处选择 KDE 图标调色板中的颜色。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:810
msgid ""
"Custom colors\n"
"\n"
"Here you can build a palette of custom colors.\n"
"Just double-click on a box to edit the color"
msgstr ""
"自定义颜色\n"
"\n"
"您可以在这里建立自定义颜色的面板。\n"
"双击色块即可编辑颜色"

#: kiconedit.cpp:816
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"新建\n"
"\n"
"从模板创建新图标，或自行指定尺寸创建"

#: kiconedit.cpp:819
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"打开\n"
"\n"
"打开已有的图标"

#: kiconedit.cpp:822
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"保存\n"
"\n"
"保存当前图标"

#: kiconedit.cpp:825
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon. (Doesn't realy work "
"as expected"
msgstr ""
"打印\n"
"\n"
"打开打印对话框以打印当前图标。（功能尚未完善，实际效果可能与预期不符）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:829
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"剪切\n"
"\n"
"将当前选区从图标中剪切\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可使用矩形或圆形选区）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:833
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"复制\n"
"\n"
"将当前选区从图标中复制\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可使用矩形或圆形选区）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:837
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents is larger than the current icon you can paste it in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparent)"
msgstr ""
"粘贴\n"
"\n"
"将剪贴板的内容粘贴到当前图标。\n"
"\n"
"如果剪贴板内容大于当前图标，可粘贴到新窗口。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：若希望粘贴透明像素，可在配置对话框中勾选“粘贴透明像素”）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:844
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a section of the icon using the mouse.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"选择\n"
"\n"
"使用鼠标选择图标的某区域。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：可使用矩形或圆形选区）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:848
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"调整大小\n"
"\n"
"平滑地调整图标大小，并尽量保留原图内容"

#: kiconedit.cpp:851
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"灰度\n"
"\n"
"将当前图标转为灰度。\n"
"（警告：转换结果可能含有图标调色板以外的颜色）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:855
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Hold the button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined scale"
msgstr ""
"缩小\n"
"\n"
"缩小一级。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：按住按钮数秒可缩放到预设比例）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:859
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Hold the button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined scale"
msgstr ""
"放大\n"
"\n"
"放大一级。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：按住按钮数秒可缩放到预设比例）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:863
msgid ""
"Toggle grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"网格\n"
"\n"
"在图标编辑网格上显示或隐藏网格线"

#: kiconedit.cpp:866
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new Icon Editor window."
msgstr ""
"新建窗口\n"
"\n"
"打开一个新的图标编辑器窗口。"

#: kiconedit.cpp:869
msgid ""
"Whats is...?\n"
"\n"
"Well since you're reading this I guess you found out ;-)"
msgstr ""
"这是什么？\n"
"\n"
"既然您在读这段说明，您已经知道答案了 ;-)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:872
msgid ""
"Drag source\n"
"\n"
"From this button you can drag out a copy of the current icon and drop it on "
"a drop enabled window, eg. another Icon Editor.\n"
"\n"
"(Note: The drag source uses the QT XDND protocol which is not yet standard "
"in KDE)"
msgstr ""
"拖动源\n"
"\n"
"点击此按钮可拖出当前图标的副本，并放到支持拖放的窗口中，例如另一个图标编辑器。\n"
"\n"
"（注意：拖动源使用 Qt XDND 协议，该协议在 KDE 中尚未成为标准）"

#: kiconedit.cpp:880
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"自由曲线\n"
"\n"
"绘制任意曲线"

#: kiconedit.cpp:883
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"填充颜色\n"
"\n"
"用当前颜色填充相邻的同色像素"

#: kiconedit.cpp:886
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"矩形\n"
"\n"
"绘制矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:889
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"填充矩形\n"
"\n"
"绘制填充矩形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:892
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"圆形\n"
"\n"
"绘制圆形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:895
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"填充圆形\n"
"\n"
"绘制填充圆形"

#: kiconedit.cpp:898
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"椭圆\n"
"\n"
"绘制椭圆"

#: kiconedit.cpp:901
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"填充椭圆\n"
"\n"
"绘制填充椭圆"

#: kiconedit.cpp:904
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontically or in 45 dgr. angles"
msgstr ""
"直线\n"
"\n"
"绘制水平、垂直或 45 度角的直线"

#: kiconedit.cpp:907
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"喷涂\n"
"\n"
"在当前颜色下绘制随机散布的像素"

#: kiconedit.cpp:910
msgid ""
"Find\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current drawcolor"
msgstr ""
"取色\n"
"\n"
"将点击的像素颜色设为当前绘制色"

#: kiconedit.cpp:913
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparent with a different tool then first click "
"on \"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"橡皮擦\n"
"\n"
"擦除像素，将像素设为透明。\n"
"\n"
"（提示：若希望以透明方式使用其他工具，请先点“橡皮擦”，再选择要使用的工具）"

